internlm3_8b_instruct__arc_test_00082_02dec4b3__temp0.10__seed7,internlm3_8b_instruct,internlm/InternLM3-8B-Instruct,arc_test_00082_02dec4b3,arc,arc_challenge,arc,82,A,1,"When considering which item can safely be reused after an investigation, it's important to think about potential contamination or residue that might remain on the item. Glassware used to heat liquids could potentially leave residues or pose a safety risk if not thoroughly cleaned. Filter paper used to filter water is likely to retain the material being filtered, making it unsuitable for reuse without proper cleaning and sterilization. Paper towels used to soak up water can be reused if they are clean and dry, but they may not be suitable for all applications. Powdered chemicals cleaned from a spill could still pose a hazard if not properly disposed of or cleaned, especially if they are toxic or reactive.",C,C,0,75,0,0,119,256,-0.2927875518798828,0.7236591577529907,1.0575566291809082,15.66203498840332,0.0,0.0,0.0,3.31,0.0,66.9265673509799,3.8250878557310592,16.430450916290283,7,0.1,cuda,minimal_json,default,0,1,json_exact,json_field,json_field,json_field,1,0,798,256,"```json
{
  ""thought"": ""When considering which item can safely be reused after an investigation, it's important to think about potential contamination or residue that might remain on the item. Glassware used to heat liquids could potentially leave residues or pose a safety risk if not thoroughly cleaned. Filter paper used to filter water is likely to retain the material being filtered, making it unsuitable for reuse without proper cleaning and sterilization. Paper towels used to soak up water can be reused if they are clean and dry, but they may not be suitable for all applications. Powdered chemicals cleaned from a spill could still pose a hazard if not properly disposed of or cleaned, especially if they are toxic or reactive."",
  ""answer"": ""C"",
  ""confidence"": 75,
  ""stop"": false
}
```"
