  ""thought"": ""To determine the mass comparison between one liter of feathers and one liter of iron nails, we need to consider the density of each material. Feathers are typically much less dense than iron nails. Therefore, even though both samples have the same volume (one liter), the mass of the iron nails will be significantly greater due to their higher density."",
