# Task Description
Determine the process that occurred when Robert added ammonia to vinegar containing a color indicator, which caused the color to change and then disappear.

# Provided Information
- Robert added 2 drops of an indicator into vinegar, and the color turned red.
- Adding drops of ammonia solution made the color disappear.

# Options
A. Rusting
B. Melting
C. Evaporation
D. Neutralization

# Solution Steps
1. Identify the initial"
